# Zap

Mobile-first direct-chat application with instant profiles, unique Zap IDs, shareable direct-chat links, and configurable natural conversation workflows.

## Planned
- Instant profile creation without email verification
- Unique Zap ID
- Search by Zap ID
- Direct chat links
- User-to-user chat interface
- Configurable delayed responses
- Custom conversation message sequences
- Admin controls
- Supabase backend
- Vercel deployment
